# The champion with reach: c_artillery joins the composition.
#
# The siege arm, remade on the nocover champion. Its first measurement (0/12,
# all-arms batch) predates every defence-era fix AND rode the cover flag that
# cover24-hard later refuted outright, so it tells us nothing about this
# lineage. The case is unchanged and sharper after the Impossible autopsy
# (log 2026-07-30): non-wins end against turret walls that out-range every
# unit we field, and c_artillery (landFactory, 290 reach) out-ranges them
# back ([[mechanics-tech-tree]]). In the goals means in the sustained
# production mix, so waves arrive with standoff fire behind them.

name techprobe
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 1
